@startuml
title RF14 — Orçamento da franquia, teto salarial e empréstimo · Máquina de estados: BankLoan (ciclo do empréstimo) × BudgetRequest.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : principal creditado no caixa (não no teto)
ACTIVE : parcela a cada WeekCompleted
state "OVERDUE" as OVERDUE
OVERDUE : caixa negativo na parcela
OVERDUE : FINE 2 % · alerta da diretoria
state "RENEGOTIATED" as RENEGOTIATED
RENEGOTIATED : prazo +8 semanas
RENEGOTIATED : juros +0,5 pp
state "SETTLED" as SETTLED
SETTLED : última parcela ou quitação (×0,97)
state "BudgetRequest PENDING" as REQ_PENDING
REQ_PENDING : aguarda a diretoria
state "BudgetRequest APPROVED / PARTIAL" as REQ_APPROVED
REQ_APPROVED : ledger BOARD_GRANT
state "BudgetRequest REJECTED" as REQ_REJECTED
REQ_REJECTED : boardResponse no inbox
REQ_REJECTED : moralClub −2
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> OVERDUE : caixa < parcela
OVERDUE --> ACTIVE : caixa recuperado
ACTIVE --> RENEGOTIATED : settle EXTEND
OVERDUE --> RENEGOTIATED : settle EXTEND
RENEGOTIATED --> ACTIVE : novo cronograma
ACTIVE --> SETTLED : última parcela ou PAYOFF
RENEGOTIATED --> SETTLED : PAYOFF
REQ_PENDING --> REQ_APPROVED : moralClub ≥ 40 e caixa ok
REQ_PENDING --> REQ_REJECTED : moralClub < 40 ou metas atrasadas
SETTLED --> [*]
REQ_APPROVED --> [*]
REQ_REJECTED --> [*]
@enduml
